= Autumn 2027 — polling day

The campaign reaches its final test. Voters choose among every active
committee; each faces its threshold, 460 Sejm seats are apportioned, and one
winner is counted in each of 100 Senate districts.

Certification will settle the balance of the new parliament. Then comes the
political reckoning for the coalition's record and the country it leaves
behind.

- @count_parliamentary_election_2027

